    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">12 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Arrays</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Hash set membership</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/contains-duplicate/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 217</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Contains Duplicate</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Keep a hash set of the values you have already read; the first value that is already in the set is a repeat, so return true right there. One pass, O(n) expected time, O(n) space. Sorting first trades the memory for O(n log n) time.</p>\n"
